    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκωφ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deafen, stun,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Ἀθήνας ἐκκεκώφηκας βοῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					312
				</span></i>
			 : —
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ δέ μευ φρένες ἐκκεκωφέαται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					81
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ κάλλος
				ἐκκεκώφηται ξίφη</span>
			<i>are blunted</i> at the sight of.., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1288
			</span></i>, cf. sq.</div>
